/* ===== 4.49 Profile updates: one page for ERTs and staff (a fix release for 4.48) =====
   Who may do what: Roster Manage (ERTs) or Staff Members Manage (staff) lets you SEND requests for that group; the Profile updates permission on top of access to the group lets you
   SEE what came back and APPROVE it. Everyone who can send sees the status of every request for their groups. The tabs follow your groups, with room for a third (HSC).
   Also: the circle button (select all / clear) and Status while ticking; the Staff list strip, ticking, status and Request update in the menu, highest position first;
   the page is called Profile updates; Home numbers are green when zero. Functions below replace the 4.48 ones of the same name. */
