/* ===== 4.75 Atlantic step 4: leave through the SAME engine as staff leave (Option A, Akeem 10 Oct 2026) =====
   Atlantic people are roster records; on the Leave page they become leave people with the id a_<roster id>.
   Their requests (leavereq) and leave (staffleave) carry atl:true and are kept OUT of every staff list at the source.
   While the Leave page is set to Atlantic, the engine is drawn with the Atlantic people, leave and allowances (atlWith).
   Recorded by an Atlantic manager: waits for an Executive. Recorded by an Executive: approved at once (Akeem, 10 Oct). */
