/* ===== 4.95 (Akeem, 13 Oct 2026): GO LIVE. One tap on the reset card clears everything recorded in the app (the app has not gone live yet);
   the profiles and their information stay. The tick list below stays for test resets. ===== */
function glrGoLiveCard(){if(!S.isOwner)return '';
  return '<div class="card glr glr1"><h3>Go live</h3><div class="none">Clears everything recorded in the app in one go, so the company starts clean: jobs and crews, ER Log tickets, work hours, ERT days and time sheets, the Payroll copies and notes, crew confirmations, requests and profile updates, <b>all leave</b> (sick, vacation, casual and Atlantic) and its bookings, training registrations and classes, <b>job letters</b>, signatures, availability and the <b>History</b>. Numbers start again: JOB #1, leave 0001, tickets from 1.</div><div class="none"><b>Kept:</b> every profile and its information (ERT, Staff Members, CVs, photos, certificates, documents), accounts and sign-in links, the access list and departments, positions, leave allowances, Rates, sites, vehicles, courses, Proposals and all settings.</div><div class="none">A backup is saved first, and you must type GO LIVE. Use it once, when you hand the app over. The ticks below are for test resets.</div><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="btn danger" data-act="glr-golive"'+(S.maintBusy?' disabled':'')+'>'+(S.maintBusy?'Working\u2026':'Go live: clear everything')+'</button></div></div>'}
