/* ===== 5.11 (Akeem, 16 Oct 2026): ONE HEADER STANDARD (UNIVERSAL RULE 96), from the Claude app sizes he chose:
   buttons with a background 37 x 37 (radius 11) with a 20 px icon; icons without a background 20 px; text buttons 37 high; the (i) circle 22;
   every header button has an invisible tap area of at least 48 x 48; titles 17 px bold. Atlantic home: shift name 21 (PC 27), ON DUTY 10,
   Up Next "UP NEXT  Shift * I/C * Name". Names in lists 15 px (Atlantic 600 like the Roster). ===== */
