try{[['Shift status','Who sees Shift status, and what?','<p>Atlantic Supervisors and Assistant Supervisors. On duty you see your own shift and the incoming shift; off duty, your own shift only. The incoming shift shows only the kind of leave (Sick, Vacation, Casual), never how long. Illness is never shown.</p>'],
 ['Shift status','Who arranges cover?','<p>The shift on duty fills only the incoming shift’s next shift. The person’s own shift arranges the rest of their tour once the tour has started: shifts in a row, never more than are left. Ongoing sick leave is covered one shift at a time.</p>'],
 ['Shift status','What if someone cancels a cover?','<p>They can cancel in the app until the cover starts. The shift opens again, the supervisors are told, and they are asked to call a supervisor of the shift on duty. After that, a change goes by phone to a supervisor.</p>']].forEach(function(q){V516_GUIDE.push(q)})}catch(e){}

