/* V5.93 (Akeem, 28 Nov 2026): Leave on its own, build 1. Leave's own settings live in Leave's own records (staffleave/_settings, the reference counters _seq and _seqatl);
   a person's own vacation and sick amounts move from the staff profile into _settings.vsOwn (Executives only, in Leave settings). Fixes: Allowances no longer erases the other Leave settings,
   an Atlantic ongoing sick leave closes with the right paid days, carry-over is worked out from last year's own entitlement, a request for next year is checked against next year,
   leave across 31 December is split by the days that count, the same request cannot be approved twice, a come-back-early request is refused when the leave has changed. */
